Package: cic
Title: Personal Utilities for Single-Cell Data Analysis
Version: 0.4.1
Authors@R: person("Cicada", email = "cicada_7x@163.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A collection of personal utilities for single-cell sequencing
    data analysis. Provides a common output-path policy, output logging,
    plot export with protection against accidental file overwrites, and an interactive editor
    for named lists of marker genes, colours, and cell type orders.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://github.com/cicada478/cic,
    https://cicada478.github.io/cic/
